"FEC-1909934 F99 by ARIZONA MOVEMENT LABS (C00880856)                                                "
"Signed by: Howie Stanger on 2025-08-01                                                              "
"                                                                                                    "
"Miscellaneous Text                                                                                  "
"  Committee      ARIZONA MOVEMENT LABS (C00880856)                                                  "
"  Address        1110 N VIRGIL AVE, #375                                                            "
"                 LOS ANGELES, CA 90029                                                              "
"                                                                                                    "
"Message                                                                                             "
"  │ To Whom It May Concern:                                                                         "
"  │                                                                                                 "
"  │ A late notification for the Mid-Year FEC report was sent to the email address on this           "
"  │ committee's Form 1 today, August 1, 2025.                                                       "
"  │                                                                                                 "
"  │ The committee filed a termination report on March 5, 2025, and received a termination approval  "
"  │ from the commission on March 10, 2025.                                                          "
"  │                                                                                                 "
"  │ We kindly request that the commission's records be updated to reflect that this committee has   "
"  │ been terminated.                                                                                "
"  │                                                                                                 "
"  │ Sincerely,                                                                                      "
"  │                                                                                                 "
"  │ Howie Stanger                                                                                   "
"  │ Treasurer                                                                                       "
